      "Skull X-ray or CT showing premature craniosynostosis",
      "MRI for hydrocephalus or brain anomalies",
      "Hand and foot radiographs showing broad thumbs and halluces"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Mutations in FGFR1 or FGFR2 genes associated with syndrome"
    ],
